  "description": "A .NET library implementing the Specification pattern — small, composable, named rule objects that encapsulate query logic. Specifications (specs) work identically against in-memory collections (IEnumerable<T>) and (database) queries (IQueryable<T>), compose with &, |, and ! operators, and are well suited to be used with LINQ.",
